  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Furious that a guest walked out, Vika brings the ruined dish back into the kitchen and demands that Chef Barinov find out who dumped salt on it. Moments later, that very same guest visits Arcobaleno and tells Elena Pavlovna that Claude Monet's kitchen is falling apart without Barinov.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "По-твоему, это нормально?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто это сделал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Из-за него у нас гость ушел.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я разберусь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вот именно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Или я сам блюда забрал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ну, ушел и ушел.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Иди работай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Знаете, не стал дожидаться возвращения Виктора Петровича.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Как оказалось, очень зря.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Только что был в Мане.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Принесли мне блюда с горой соли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Наверное, у них кухня.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "По-твоему, это нормально?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In your opinion, is this normal?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто это сделал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who did this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Из-за него у нас гость ушел.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because of him, a guest walked out on us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я разберусь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will get to the bottom of this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вот именно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is right.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Или я сам блюда забрал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Or did I ruin the dish myself?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ну, ушел и ушел.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, he left, big deal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Иди работай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go back to work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Знаете, не стал дожидаться возвращения Виктора Петровича.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You know, I decided not to wait for Viktor Petrovich to return.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Как оказалось, очень зря.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As it turned out, that was a big mistake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Только что был в Мане.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was just at Claude Monet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Принесли мне блюда с горой соли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They brought me a dish buried under a mountain of salt.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Наверное, у них кухня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Their kitchen must be falling apart without him.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
